    "summary": "AUSTIN, Texas, August 04, 2026--CrowdStrike Holdings, Inc. (Nasdaq: CRWD), today announced that it will release financial results for its fiscal second quarter 2027 ended July 31, 2026 after the U.S. market close on Wednesday, August 26, 2026. CrowdStrike will host a conference call that day at 2:00 p.m. Pacific time (5:00 p.m. Eastern time) to discuss the results.",
